Third-party notices for the Screengine libraries
================================================

Screengine itself is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0; see LICENSE-MIT and
LICENSE-APACHE. It has no third-party dependencies. The compiled libraries in
this archive (screengine.dll, screengine.lib, libscreengine.so,
libscreengine.a, screengine.wasm) nevertheless contain parts of the Rust
toolchain, listed below with the notices their licenses require.

The same file ships with every target. Some components are present only on
some targets; each section says which.


